    "{name}——うちのエースが最も意識している存在だ。次に当たるときは因縁を含んだカードになる": "{name} — the one your ace is most conscious of. Next time they meet, the match carries history with it.",
    "{name}——総合力{ovr}、人気{pop}。こちらのエースと真正面からぶつかれる数少ない相手だ": "{name} — an Overall of {ovr}, a popularity of {pop}. One of the few who can meet your ace head-on.",
    "{name}、{age}歳。人気{pop}という数字が、すでに観客の評価を物語っている": "{name}, age {age}. A popularity figure of {pop} already tells you how the crowd has graded her.",
