    "{name}、総合力+{ovrGain}。成長曲線が急すぎて、来季にはエース級になっていてもおかしくない": "{name}, Overall up {ovrGain}. The curve is steep enough that ace class next season would surprise nobody.",
    "{name}、総合力{ovr}で人気{pop}。実力と人気のバランスが良く、どのカードにも組み込める": "{name}, an Overall of {ovr} on a popularity of {pop}. The balance between ability and name is good, and she fits anywhere on a card.",
    "{name}、若手ながら存在感を出し始めている。数年後の脅威を今のうちに潰すか、育ちきるのを待つか": "{name} is young and starting to be felt. Put the threat down now, or wait for her to finish growing.",
    "{name}。今季総合力+{ovrGain}の急成長だ。半年前まで脅威でもなんでもなかったのに、見違えた": "{name}. Overall up {ovrGain} this season. Half a year ago she was no threat to anyone. She is a different wrestler now.",
    "{name}が{count}回防衛——王座戦線の中心に": "{name} at defense {count} — center of the title race",
    "{name}が{count}連勝、視線を集める": "{name} at {count} in a row, drawing eyes",
    "{name}が{detail}。成長を結果へつなげられるか、今後のカードが試金石になる。": "{name}: {detail}. Whether the growth turns into results is what the coming cards will test.",
    "{name}が{fromOrg}を離れ、{toOrg}に加わることが決まった。対戦相手の顔ぶれが変わる以上、これまでの戦い方がそのまま通じるとは限らない。": "{name} is confirmed to be leaving {fromOrg} and joining {toOrg}. When the faces across the ring change, there is no guarantee the way she has fought until now still works.",
    "{name}が{how}して数週が過ぎた。環境が変われば、練習相手も控室の並びも変わる。数字に出るまでには時間がかかるが、変化はまず立ち居振る舞いに出るものだ。": "{name}, a few weeks on: {how}. Change the setting and the training partners change, and so does where she stands in the locker room. It takes time to reach the numbers. It reaches the way she carries herself first.",
    "{name}が{name2}を下した一戦の評価は{mq}点。旧記録の{prevRecord}点を上回り、業界の歴代最高が更新された。舞台は{stage}。派手な決着ではなかったが、攻防の密度がそのまま数字に出た。狙って出せる記録ではない。この日、それがひとつ塗り替わった。": "The match in which {name} beat {name2} was rated {mq}. That passes the old mark of {prevRecord} and sets a new all-time best for the business. The setting: {stage}. The finish was not a loud one, but the density of the exchanges came straight out in the number. This is not a record anyone produces on purpose. On this day one of them was rewritten anyway.",
    "{name}が{prevChamp}を下し、新チャンピオンの座に就いた。前王者の雪辱戦も含め、{org}の王座戦線は新たな局面を迎える。": "{name} beat {prevChamp} and took the champion's seat. With a rematch for the former champion among the possibilities, the {org} title picture enters a new phase.",
    "{name}が{toOrg}に加入——{fromOrg}から移籍": "{name} joins {toOrg}, ex-{fromOrg}",
    "{name}が{toOrg}の選手として{ourOrg}に挑む日が来た。試合前、控室で長く動かなかったという。リング上で何が解放されるのか、注視せざるを得ない一戦となった。": "The day came for {name} to face {ourOrg} in {toOrg} colors. Before the match, they say she sat still in the locker room a long time. What gets let out in that ring bears watching.",
    "{name}が{toOrg}へ――ベルトは置いて去った": "{name} to {toOrg} — belt left behind",
    "{name}が{toOrg}へ――契約交渉決裂": "{name} to {toOrg} — talks break down",
    "{name}が{what}を果たしてから数週が過ぎた。大きな実績を一度きりで終わらせず、次の勝利へつなげられるか。今後の対戦カードと試合内容に注目したい。": "A few weeks have passed since {name} did it: {what}. Whether a big result stays a one-off or turns into the next win is the question. The cards ahead, and what she does inside them, are worth watching.",
    "{name}がリングに上がった。{age}歳。デビュー戦は{result}に終わった。数字上の勝敗より、スカウト筋がこの新人に付けていた評価のほうが業界を騒がせている。関係者の間では「ここ数年で一番の素材」との声が入団前から流れていた。実物を見た記者席のざわめきが、その評判を裏づけた。": "{name} stepped into the ring. Age {age}. The debut ended one way: {result}. What has the business talking is less the result than the grade the scouts had already put on her. Word going around before she signed was that this is the best material in several years. The noise from the press seats, once they had seen her, backed that up.",
    "{name}が化けている。総合力+{ovrGain}。放っておくと手がつけられなくなる": "{name} has turned into a different wrestler. Overall up {ovrGain}. Leave this much longer and nobody will be able to handle her.",
